  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "↵今天早上通勤上班时，我考虑开车是否是一个可行的选择。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "google-map-show-traffic-alerts-during-route-planning-in-hong-kong",
        "title": "Google 地图在香港路线规划期间显示交通警报",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/google-map-show-traffic-alerts-during-route-planning-in-hong-kong/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "我的新工作地点在东涌，我通常搭乘巴士和港铁通勤。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "google-map-show-traffic-alerts-during-route-planning-in-hong-kong",
        "title": "Google 地图在香港路线规划期间显示交通警报",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/google-map-show-traffic-alerts-during-route-planning-in-hong-kong/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "我使用 iPhone 访问 Google 地图，点击目的地，并检查哪条路线更好。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "google-map-show-traffic-alerts-during-route-planning-in-hong-kong",
        "title": "Google 地图在香港路线规划期间显示交通警报",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/google-map-show-traffic-alerts-during-route-planning-in-hong-kong/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "令我惊讶的是，其中一条路线显示了交通警报！",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "google-map-show-traffic-alerts-during-route-planning-in-hong-kong",
        "title": "Google 地图在香港路线规划期间显示交通警报",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/google-map-show-traffic-alerts-during-route-planning-in-hong-kong/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "我原以为这个功能是 Apple 地图独有的，并且只在某些主要城市（如纽约市）可用。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "google-map-show-traffic-alerts-during-route-planning-in-hong-kong",
        "title": "Google 地图在香港路线规划期间显示交通警报",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/google-map-show-traffic-alerts-during-route-planning-in-hong-kong/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "我从未想过它会在香港可用。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "google-map-show-traffic-alerts-during-route-planning-in-hong-kong",
        "title": "Google 地图在香港路线规划期间显示交通警报",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/google-map-show-traffic-alerts-during-route-planning-in-hong-kong/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "我切换检查从东涌到香港岛的路线。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "google-map-show-traffic-alerts-during-route-planning-in-hong-kong",
        "title": "Google 地图在香港路线规划期间显示交通警报",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/google-map-show-traffic-alerts-during-route-planning-in-hong-kong/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "看起来交通警报仅针对东行交通。↵",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "google-map-show-traffic-alerts-during-route-planning-in-hong-kong",
        "title": "Google 地图在香港路线规划期间显示交通警报",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/google-map-show-traffic-alerts-during-route-planning-in-hong-kong/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "接下来，我通过切换回从香港岛到东涌的原始路线来检查西行交通。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "google-map-show-traffic-alerts-during-route-planning-in-hong-kong",
        "title": "Google 地图在香港路线规划期间显示交通警报",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/google-map-show-traffic-alerts-during-route-planning-in-hong-kong/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "果然，它显示正常交通状况。↵",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "google-map-show-traffic-alerts-during-route-planning-in-hong-kong",
        "title": "Google 地图在香港路线规划期间显示交通警报",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/google-map-show-traffic-alerts-during-route-planning-in-hong-kong/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "在网上搜索后，我找不到任何关于交通警报的相关信息。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "google-map-show-traffic-alerts-during-route-planning-in-hong-kong",
        "title": "Google 地图在香港路线规划期间显示交通警报",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/google-map-show-traffic-alerts-during-route-planning-in-hong-kong/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "直到 10 分钟后，当我回到办公室时，我才找到相关报道。↵",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "google-map-show-traffic-alerts-during-route-planning-in-hong-kong",
        "title": "Google 地图在香港路线规划期间显示交通警报",
        "url": "/zh-CN/blog/google-map-show-traffic-alerts-during-route-planning-in-hong-kong/"
